{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p030a","title":"曹叡命和洽崔林吊祭护丧并诏依帝礼","accounts":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p030a-account","label":"裴注·献帝传","text":"曹叡命和洽崔林吊祭护丧并诏依帝礼","evidence":["mingdi-e-p030a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0005","role":"遣使定礼","evidence":["mingdi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0325","role":"吊祭","evidence":["mingdi-e-p030a-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0053","role":"护丧","evidence":["mingdi-e-p030a-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":234,"label":"山阳公卒后","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"mingdi-y234","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"mingdi-q-o037","basis":"山阳公卒后"},"evidence":["mingdi-e-p030a-q","mingdi-q-o037","mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195"]},"ordering_evidence":"mingdi-e-p030a-q","source_order":[3,264,"P030a"],"order":854}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0053","name":"崔林","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0005","name":"曹叡","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0325","name":"和洽","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-p030a-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fc3b2373ccedc94baa04","layer":"pei","quote":"“帝变服，率群臣哭之。使使持节、行司徒、太常和洽吊祭，又使持节、行大司空、大司农崔林监护丧事。诏曰：‘盖五帝之事尚矣！仲尼盛称尧、舜巍巍荡荡之功者，以为禅代乃大圣之懿事也。山阳公深识天禄永终之运，禅位文皇帝以顺天命。先帝命公行汉正朔，郊天祀祖以天子之礼，言事不称“臣”，此舜事尧之义也。昔放勋殂落，四海如丧考妣，遏密八音；明丧葬之礼，同于王者也。今有司奏丧礼比诸侯王，此岂古之遗制而先帝之至意哉？今谥公“汉孝献皇帝”。’","attribution":"裴注·献帝传","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":263,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-577bfabc3a4642d33616","start":0,"end":210},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
